      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CONNECT THE DOTS (1) comes here fresh from a second in a Listed feature won by Arete Virtue three weeks ago over 1609m at Menangle. Should enjoy a lovely run and looks the testing material. THECANDYBARHEIRESS (6) went back last start and couldn't get into the race when 18 metres from the winner in sixth at Melton over 1720m. That effort followed a nice third at Melton two runs ago. This is a nice drop in grade and looks tough to beat. KYVALLEY DAYTONA (10) faces the starter for the first time. By Father Patrick and hails from the Brent Lilley stable. Trial winner who looks above average. Any push in betting will add to the confidence. WHERDASUNDONTSHINE (11) cannot be ruled out but needs a bit of luck from the tricky draw.",
